{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":94,"timestamp":"2026-09-19T04:25:52.814271Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"c3d29fee-5283-4bc5-bee3-79a789ba7e6a","comment_uuid":"5e8dcfd9-7dc9-44a0-bbfd-ffb8d663f449","author":"xqjG","content":"ROUTING (plan): spec-amendment classification — Raise to SO; enters Slice 4's phase-1a (the conformance verifier's oracle placement), owner Solution Architect, validator Security. THE DEFECT (operator, 2026-09-18: 'there isn't a centralized crosslink server'): the contract's Verifiable conformance and efficiency member states the oracle is 'the trace as synced to the crosslink server and made tamper-evident by corroboration' and names 'the sync channel' as an upstream crosslink dependency. crosslink has no server: its hub is a git branch synced to the git remote, and the contract's own server-synced authorship basis member already defines 'server-synced state' as exactly that — hub-event signatures verified against the trust store plus the driver-key fingerprint on the intervene path. A transcript-sync feature cannot be filed upstream against a server that does not exist; the impact-analysis item E1 is WITHDRAWN. WHAT THE ORACLE CAN BE (design inputs, not a ruling): (a) the trace leaves the agent's reach BEFORE the agent can touch it — a harness-level write restriction on the transcript directory (the outer-harness rung; same dependency class as the native-spawn interceptor); (b) the trace is committed to a hub/data branch and pushed by a non-agent actor — the CI runner or the operator's own act — and signed with the driver key, so the remote copy under the ruleset + signatures is the independent copy (this is what 'server-synced' has always meant for tracker events); (c) no single independent trace copy: the composite oracle is corroboration across records the agent cannot forge together — signed hub events, git history, CI run records — with every trace-based verdict permanently could-not-check-grade and the honest grade stated. Each option carries a different enforcement grade; the amendment must name it. REGISTER: entry synced-trace-oracle-unbuilt (owning issue vsdd-cli#873, closed) carries a stated_reason that presumes the server — re-scope its deviation/reason to 'the oracle's independence mechanism is unspecified' with this issue as the home, on the same branch as the amendment; its 2026-11-30 review date stands. The knowledge page verifiable-conformance-and-efficiency (REQ-10, REQ-23 leg 2) inherits the same correction as archived rationale.","created_at":"2026-09-19T04:25:52.800418Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABALLXJkdhaH/au4E4w3Sim+xC+XKBirjc4+Gez/MaBNsnPzCFJQZ45Uy4ueYXOAlVTporWY7JSaW58TF4O5JV2DA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJX2SZYvdVQFSDl9V935wYYtBrzYJHFwfWa9tofUSq1T0j1hhIweUSM7LqOXgXBF5Kp0oNSk9YVhGW72RTr8ZwY="}
