{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":160,"timestamp":"2026-09-24T22:45:46.535754Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"65b5349c-6130-4c6a-90cb-de961dd2b190","comment_uuid":"9ee27d10-e80e-4944-8297-5c38bd84a4d9","author":"xqjG","content":"ROUTING (plan): defect fix, fix lane. Owner Software Engineer; validator Quality Engineer. (a) vsdd-core/src/integrity_shell (installed-artifact integrity, off-grammar refs) is called only from tests; vsdd/src/main.rs cmd_status never joins its findings, so a hollow install is a quiet no-op — the falsifier Conformance at action time names — while build-plan Completed phases records the Status slices CLOSED. (b) acquire.rs sets round_manifests/round_children/comment_handles to empty on every live run; integrity.rs then reports round-parity and unresolvable-handles as checked-clean with no could-not-check marker (the #818 false-assurance defect recurring for two sibling checks). Fix: wire the three shell checks into cmd_status/run_statusline (unsigned-event count could-not-check until consumed); extend the readiness marker so finding_checks_not_run lists round-parity and unresolvable-handles as Dormant until acquired. If Status wiring is instead deferred, the build-plan Completed phases line and the Status detection criterion must say library-bound, fixture-closed, wiring open. Related minors: three three-valued verdict enums (one shared type); vsdd gate's legs have no GateKind variant and record nothing; two date/version conventions.","created_at":"2026-09-24T22:45:46.524248Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA7xdt6ofdtQthmhSHhpE/kl+i2cLtpyWgVuH4Sb2jMTv3AtLXrsM33IlTZaewiT1W2hMJqzcdEUrSi8/5AZgWCA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1M